  "id": "grilled-hawaiian-chicken",
  "name": "Grilled Hawaiian Chicken",
  "subtitle": "Teriyaki chicken with pineapple and brown-sugar glaze",
  "description": "Chicken breasts are marinated, grilled, and finished with pineapple and a buttery, tangy glaze.",
